{
  spec: "§7.4, §7.5"
  description: "A qualified name with an adjacent argument list is one core-value, a reference, its arguments nested to any depth: a qualified name is a reference, any other token a value argument. Whitespace and a comma inside the list are free, and a qualified head, `geo.address`, parses."
